WEBVTT

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:07.920
Okay, I'll whine a little to get
Nekotani's attention...

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:18.040
Oh, god!

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.330
Wait, what?!

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.920
That's not what was supposed to happen!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.880
Keep your eyes on me! You're my sweet good boy!

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:34.040
When I'm with you life is w-w-wonderful!

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:37.130
1, 2, 3, now jump! Affectionate attention

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:40.210
3, 2, 1, now turn! So many hot sparks

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:43.380
1-to-1, now love! Unfortunate fraction

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:46.460
From wonderful morning till night,
I'll give you everything

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:49.540
Tell me how much you love me, my little boy

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:53.130
Love me! Love me! Let me love you, I want you

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:59.460
Live your life!
Sprint forward with all you've got!

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:06.170
At the finish line is a new you
(Go beyond yourself!)

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:11.960
Howl loud and proud!
Yesterday might have beaten you down

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:15.000
But tomorrow (Affectionate Attention)
you and I (Unfortunate Fraction)

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.210
Will shine as bright as we can!

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:20.710
This is your life, your way!

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:22.380
This is my life, my way!

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:23.380
Woof!

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:30.290
Hold on, is Nekotani scared of dogs?!

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:31.170
<b>Scaredy-Cat.</b>

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:35.210
Look, I'm a tiny little puppy!
How are you on the verge of a heart attack?!

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:44.710
There goes my perfect escape plan!

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.040
Just stay over there!

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:57.080
A centipede?!

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:00.670
What's wrong with you?!

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:02.630
Go on, shoo!

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:05.880
Oh, no! She's too scared of me to notice it!

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:10.380
But I don't want it to bite her!

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:17.080
Wh-why are you jumping up on the bed?!

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:22.580
Go away!

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:25.830
Hey! Get back here, you dummy!

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.250
She whacked her knees pretty good there...

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:36.080
But now I can do something
about that centipede!

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:39.080
Crap!

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:47.290
I gotta do something, and quick!

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.500
Sorry, Nekotani...

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:55.380
She smells like tulips.

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:00.710
Don't get distracted by girl smell!

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:02.210
I've got a job to do!

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:05.540
That tickles!

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:12.250
I almost got squished there!

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.500
That was close!

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:22.040
No, not my sides...

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:24.580
Yes! Got you, you forty-legged bastard!

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:27.040
Good dogs protect Inukai-san's friends!

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:30.750
Right, now how do I get out...

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:37.710
She's gonna make me a dog pancake!

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:43.630
I'll nudge my way through here
and I'll be home free!

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:48.670
Can't breathe! It's so tight!

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.790
You dirty dog!

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:02.960
S-sorry...

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:08.040
Nekotani...

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:10.290
You really took a tumble, huh.

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:13.460
I didn't mean to scare you.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:15.540
I'm sorry.

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:18.130
You only fell 'cause I chased you.

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:20.540
A-are you mad at me?!

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:25.670
I'm a dog.

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:28.830
I can't use my words with her, but...

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:33.580
I-I'm sorry I yeeted you, okay?

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:38.000
No! Please, don't hurt me!

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.710
But I know what speaks louder than words!

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:48.580
Huh?

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:52.330
He's looking at my knee...

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:54.170
Is he gonna lick- Hey!

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:57.830
Dammit, stop!

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:05.130
Inukai-san said that dogs
lick boo-boos better.

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:11.330
Hey, cut it out! Seriously, you gotta stop!

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:14.710
Now she's gotta like me!

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:19.880
Inukai-san?!

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.330
Holy crap, she's pissed!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.380
Huh?!

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:29.290
Oh, uh, I didn't...

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:48.460
Whoa, Karen, what the hell are you doing?!

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:50.670
Yeah, what she said!

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:52.710
What the hell, Inukai-san?!

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.830
C'mon, get over here...

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:10.750
She hurt herself on purpose...

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:13.670
to try and get me to lick her boo-boo?!

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:23.000
C'mere, lick my toes too, sweetie!

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:26.460
If I don't, is she gonna hurt herself again?!

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:30.040
Fine, then!

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:40.500
Guess I've got no choice!

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:59.750
Your tongue is so rough...

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:04.330
Nekotani's freaked out.

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:06.500
Totally normal reaction.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:09.670
She's never seen Inukai-san act like this.

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:15.040
So, Nekotani.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:24.580
What were you doing with Pochita
while I was gone?

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:28.710
H-he got inside my dress...

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:32.000
He went in there on his own?

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:34.210
Not because of some accident?!

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:36.330
Y-yeah?

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:42.210
Sh-she's got it all wrong, Inukai-san!

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:45.130
As soon as my back was turned,

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:47.790
you put your hands and body
all over my Pochita?!

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:50.920
Y-you traitor!

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.380
You traitor.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:01.830
I haven't even gotten to do that yet.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:09.380
That changes now.

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:16.630
Wait, is she seriously gonna force me
to go up and into her dress?!

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.040
I-I gotta get away!

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:27.540
Pochita, Pochita, Pochita!

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:32.710
She's chasing me!

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:33.960
Fine, then!

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:37.630
Through the legs!

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:44.580
Any other time,
I'd love to be all up in her dress!

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:48.040
But it won't count if I'm a dog!

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:51.380
Come home!

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.750
That's home?!

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:54.380
What?!

00:08:57.210 --> 00:08:59.420
Nekotani looks like she needs eye bleach!

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:03.250
Uh, Karen, what the actual hell are you doing?

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.630
C'mere, Pochita!

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:09.960
So... If I don't crawl in there,
is Inukai-san just gonna sit there like that?

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:14.420
Okay, fine. I'll go!

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:17.880
I'll go home, sweet home, to Inukai-san!

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:24.580
See, Nekotani? This is proof of
the loving bond I have with Pochita!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.710
Get that, now?

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:30.880
What kind of "loving" bond
is that supposed to be?!

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:33.580
Huh? I can't see without any light...

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:36.790
There's light from up here...

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:39.790
Good boy! You figured it out!

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:43.210
She's really happy.

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:49.170
Wait, were you pissed because you were
jealous of me and your dog?

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:52.540
And here I thought you'd have
resting bitch face for the rest of your life.

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:57.380
Until you helped her, huh?

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:03.250
Pochita's mine, you got that?!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.920
I'm not gonna steal him, promise!

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:12.580
Aight, see ya, Karen.

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:14.460
And, uh...

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:22.250
Bye, Pochita. Good boy.

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:27.290
Thanks for getting that centipede.

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:30.080
She figured it out!

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:35.380
I mean, I didn't get her to take me home,

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:37.380
but I think she at least likes me now?

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:41.880
This one, on the other hand,
is pissed again.

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:49.830
Look, I'm just glad her study sesh
with Nekotani went off without a hitch.

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:54.290
Oh, Pochita!

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:55.290
What?

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:06.750
Come home! Come home! Come home! Come home!

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:10.380
Come home! Come home! Come home! Come home!

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:12.630
Let's Go! Come Home, Boy!

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:17.210
You're so cute, I can't help but love you!

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:22.380
I'll take you home and make you happy,
so c'mere, boy!

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:26.500
The secret moments when I pet and kiss you

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:31.540
Are precious moments to be honest about my love

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:34.080
This feeling I'm yearning for

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.460
This feeling I've been hiding

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.830
This feeling I've finally found

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:40.500
Hear it now! Feel it now!

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:42.500
I l-l-l-l-love you!

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:46.210
I hope my feelings will reach you one day

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:50.580
One day, when you look up and see me

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:53.130
I wanna be number one in your puppy heart!

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:56.000
From the bottom of my heart, I love you!
